om T022 and the empty `comm` output over `$SP/claude-listing.txt` from T023 Met 2026-11-13: `scratch/claude-observed.txt` reads `visibility claude 44/44`, 13 entries in `.claude/commands/create` with `sk-skill.md` among them and a `skill.md` count of 0. The coordinator ran T023 in place of the operator, in a throwaway folder outside any repository. `scratch/claude-expected.txt` holds 44 names, `comm -23` against the listing prints nothing and the listing holds 13 `create:` names. Receipts: `scratch/claude-observed.txt:1` `scratch/claude-observed.txt:13` `scratch/claude-observed.txt:16` `scratch/claude-listing.txt:11` | Met | - |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/016-claude-create-reach-and-doctor-default/tasks.md:227:- [x] CHK-FIX-003 [P0] Every consumer of a changed output is in the `plan.md` addendum. Evidence: the generator list and the `OLD` scan name no file outside it. Done 2026-11-13: `OLD` names no file outside the addendum except the new changelog entry. Two consumers were not in the addendum: the sk-doc compiled-route manifest with its authored twin, refreshed by its own command, and the install contract test, which T032 updated.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/report.md:7:- SA4-P1-002: CONFIRMED P1. A refusal over \"A or B\" keeps the second command. `do not run /create:agent or /create:readme` gives `/create:readme (start)` on the top row; `never use /create:readme or /create:feature-catalog` gives `/create:feature-catalog (start)`; `do not run /deep:review, or /deep:research` gives `/deep:research (ask)`. Fix: carry a refusal over or-lists in `commandOnlyMentioned` (command-attach.ts).\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/containment/quarantine/1/content/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md:283:| Review pass four verification, 