, sealed plain 1 of 44, scorer eval 160, 51 and 21), and the advisor suite, the doctor tests, the session reader tests, the history lookup tests, the OpenCode plugin test and the typecheck report 0 failed. |\n283-| REQ-005 | `scratch/rescore-delta.txt` holds every runtime and arm of the three stored summaries before and after. No workflow count, load rate, followed rate, `unsafe`, `loops` or `loopsWithoutInit` moves, and a move is a finding that blocks the task. Each newly counted start names its runtime, arm, row, row type, policy and the rule that moved it, none sits on a refusal, question or small-edit row or each such start has a fix or a reason, and the parent goal log restates each moved start figure in rows whose evidence starts with `tuned rows, one run each, no brief reached Codex`. |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"REQ-001\\\" -A 4 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/027-review-pass-four-remediation/spec.md | head -20\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683310048,"end":1794683310810}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683310853,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","part":{"partID":"prt_1db760bd40018JzFrWriFC24o3","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","messageID":"msg_1db75a272001ukhn0jhrElTyCo","type":"tool","id":"call_7b74ef5d223445d69f8f5a6f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/probes/cli-rows.sh 2>/dev/null | head -40; ls specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/probes/","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Prints the first three public rows (skill, command, policy) the advisor CLI returns per prompt.\ncd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research || exit 2\nfor p in \"$@\"; do\n  printf '%s => ' \"$p\"\n  env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend \\\n    --json \"$(jq -nc --arg p \"$p\" '{prompt:$p}')\" --format json 2>/dev/null \\\n    | jq -c '[.data.recommendations[0:3][] | [.skillId, (.command // \"-\"), (.policy // \"-\")]]'\ndone\ncli-rows.sh\ncodex-toctou.mjs\nholdout-guard-emulation.sh\nmake-heredoc-variant.sh\nmake-shell-start-variant.sh\nofferedas-backfill.mjs\npaired-arm.sh\ntop-only-head.sh\ntop-only-sweep-doctor.txt\ntop-only-sweep-labeled.txt\ntop-only-sweep.sh\ntranscript-shell.mjs\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Prints the first three public rows (skill, command, policy) the advisor CLI returns per prompt.\ncd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research || exit 2\nfor p in \"$@\"; do\n  printf '%s => ' \"$p\"\n  env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend \\\n    --json \"$(jq -nc --arg p \"$p\" '{prompt:$p}')\" --format json 2>/dev/null \\\n    | jq -c '[.data.recommendations[0:3][] | [.skillId, (.command // \"-\"), (.policy // \"-\")]]'\ndone\ncli-rows.sh\ncodex-toctou.mjs\nholdout-guard-emulation.sh\nmake-heredoc-variant.sh\nmake-shell-start-variant.sh\nofferedas-backfill.mjs\npaired-arm.sh\ntop-only-head.sh\ntop-only-sweep-doctor.txt\ntop-only-sweep-labeled.txt\ntop-only-sweep.sh\ntranscript-shell.mjs\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/probes/cli-rows.sh 2>/dev/null | head -40; ls specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/verify-4/probes/\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683309012,"end":1794683310853}}}}
