-scaffold /doctor:ci scaffold ask',\n  ],\n  counterevidenceSought: 'REQ-001 names only three single-word refusals; A3 and the Out-of-Scope line (P049) record a question over an or-list as unreproduced, but no record declares two-word commands out of the or-list grammar. SA4-P1-001 and SA4-P1-003 are different accepted limits. A two-word final item works, so the failure is positional.',\n  alternativeExplanation: 'T028 authored the item pattern with one token on purpose, so the authors may treat a two-word /doctor command as outside the or-list shape. That is not recorded, and the constant comment claims every joined command while TRACKED_COMMANDS ships the two-word rows.',\n  finalSeverity: 'P1',\n  confidence: 'high',\n  downgradeTrigger: 'Downgrade to P2 if a packet doc or adjudication record declares the or-list grammar single-token only, or declares multi-word /doctor commands out of the typed-command and command-row withholding contract.',\n};\n\nconst record = {\n  type: 'iteration',\n  iteration: 1,\n  mode: 'review',\n  target_agent: 'deep-review',\n  agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: 'Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review',\n  run: 'fanout-scorer-attach-close-4c-1794682797954-pcdanq',\n  status: 'complete',\n  focus: 'correctness',\n  dimensions: ['correctness'],\n  filesReviewed: [\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:356-441,459-514',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:145-215,245-274',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:1200-1246',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:500',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:67-76,122',\n    'specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/027-review-pass-four-remediation/spec.md:239,279,378-390',\n    'specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-sco