{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683663125,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","part":{"partID":"prt_1db7b42ce001ahMoYgxZuC8UEM","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","messageID":"msg_1db7b1615001rKqD0uEBv2p6Qg","type":"tool","id":"call_1a051d94e8024fe1b1b4afd1","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).\n- Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -89,8 +89,9 @@\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n - Importing the real `command-attach.ts` through Node's type stripping and probing the predicate, `attachCommand` and `typedCommandForTop` in one run separated the fixed single-word rows from the failing two-word row (iteration 1).\n - Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).\n+- Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).\\n- Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683650766,"end":1794683663125}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683663151,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","part":{"partID":"prt_1db7b495a001UEM06MujbjH5rY","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","messageID":"msg_1db7b1615001rKqD0uEBv2p6Qg","type":"tool","id":"call_f474790c3a394ca4842ef9f9","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \"every command the list joins\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).\n- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \"every command the list joins\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -97,8 +97,9 @@\n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Reading the diff alone would have missed the multi-word item: the constant looks complete until it is probed with a `/doctor:` command (iteration 1).\n - Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \"every command the list joins\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).\n+- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \\\"every command the list joins\\\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).\\n- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \\\"every command the list joins\\\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683652442,"end":1794683663151}}}}
