 and probing the predicate, `attachCommand` and `typedCommandForTop` in one run separated the fixed single-word rows from the failing two-word row (iteration 1).\n - Running the advisor CLI on the same prompts turned the predicate result into a user-visible row list, which confirmed the fix and the remaining hole without touching the corpus (iteration 1).\n - Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).\n+- Reading the repeated group as a token+`or` sequence gave a bounded-backtracking argument without needing a timing run (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).\\n- Reading the repeated group as a token+`or` sequence gave a bounded-backtracking argument without needing a timing run (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- Comparing each spec sentence against a `git show` of the prior commit located the stale line pointer and the stale scope text in one pass (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683845707,"end":1794683852426}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683852431,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","part":{"partID":"prt_1db7e4294001gXUvdNl8XRkt36","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","messageID":"msg_1db7e2bbb001m4XfbS0I8l3R67","type":"tool","id":"call_31df0be2adf44b76b9a27e50","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\n- Trusting the reducer's managed strategy blocks as a faithful summary: it lists traceability bullets under Exhausted Approaches, so the block needs a hand tidy at synthesis (iteration 3).","oldString":"- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -99,8 +99,9 @@\n \n - Reading the diff alone would have missed the multi-word item: the constant looks complete until it is probed with a `/doctor:` command (iteration 1).\n - Extrapolating from the three REQ-001 refusals to \"every command the list joins\" is unsound; the reachable vocabulary decides (iteration 1).\n - Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\n+- Trusting the reducer's managed strategy blocks as a faithful summary: it lists traceability bullets under Exhausted Approaches, so the block needs a hand tidy at synthesis (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\\n- Trusting the reducer's managed strategy blocks as a faithful summary: it lists traceability bullets under Exhausted Approaches, so the block needs a hand tidy at synthesis (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- Reading the spec's Out-of-Scope line as current scope would have hidden that T029 had already implemented the question carry; the tasks file is the newer record (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683847316,"end":1794683852431}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794683852437,"sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","part":{"partID":"prt_1db7e49c2001ffolUpUk1XwANh","sessionID":"ses_e2491b3d5ffeWEHdGsB4TJKTsi","messageID":"msg_1db7e2bbb001m4XfbS0I8l3R67","type":"tool","id":"call_71d811a2498b49738164880a","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- The fix over-suppresses requests: seven probed request shapes kept their command (iteration 1, evidence: tmp/probe-or-list.mjs and the CLI rows).\n- The article allowance breaks an existing question row: rows without an `or` match zero iterations of the added group (iteration 1, evidence: command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:185-198).\n- The shipped build lacks the fix: the ignored dist copy holds the same constant and three insertions (iteration 1, evidence: runtime/dist/runtime/lib/command-attach.js:331,375-386).\n- A missing hub-level row hides a distinct failure: attachCommand's only mention branch is the pinned predicate (iteration 2, evidence: command-attach.ts:492).\n- A changelog entry is missing: release notes belong to phase 025 (iteration 2, evidence: 027 spec Out of Scope).\n- Prompt-driven regex injection or catastrophic backtracking: the name is escaped, the leads are constants, and each repeated iteration consumes a token plus `or` (iteration 3, evidence: command-attach.ts:376-380,418).","oldString":"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Investigated and eliminated angles are consolidated here from iteration dead-end data]","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -201,9 +201,14 @@\n - Remaining frontier: none recorded\n \n ## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n \n-[Investigated and eliminated angles are consolidated here from iteration dead-end data]\n+- The fix over-suppresses requests: seven probed request shapes kept their command (iteration 1, evidence: tmp/probe-or-list.mjs and the CLI rows).\n+- The article allowance breaks an existing question row: rows without an `or` match zero iterations of the added group (iteration 1, evidence: command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:185-198).\n+- The shipped build lacks the fix: the ignored dist copy holds the same constant and three insertions (iteration 1, evidence: runtime/dist/runtime/lib/command-attach.js:331,375-386).\n+- A missing hub-level row hides a distinct failure: attachCommand's only mention branch is the pinned predicate (iteration 2, evidence: command-attach.ts:492).\n+- A changelog entry is missing: release notes belong to phase 025 (iteration 2, evidence: 027 spec Out of Scope).\n+- Prompt-driven regex injection or catastrophic backtracking: the name is escaped, the leads are constants, and each repeated iteration consumes a token plus `or` (iteration 3, evidence: command-attach.ts:376-380,418).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n- The fix over-suppresses requests: seven probed request shapes kept their command (iteration 1, evidence: tmp/probe-or-list.mjs and the CLI rows).\\n- The article allowance breaks an existing question row: rows without an `or` match zero iterations of the added group (iteration 1, evidence: command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:185-198).\\n- The shipped build lacks the fix: the ignored dist copy holds the same constant and three insertions (iteration 1, evidence: runtime/dist/runtime/lib/command-attach.js:331,375-386).\\n- A missing hub-level row hides a distinct failure: attachCommand's only mention branch is the pinned predicate (iteration 2, evidence: command-attach.ts:492).\\n- A changelog entry is missing: release notes belong to phase 025 (iteration 2, evidence: 027 spec Out of Scope).\\n- Prompt-driven regex injection or catastrophic backtracking: the name is escaped, the leads are constants, and each repeated iteration consumes a token plus `or` (iteration 3, evidence: command-attach.ts:376-380,418).\",\"oldString\":\"## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Investigated and eliminated angles are consolidated here from iteration dead-end data]\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683849154,"end":1794683852437}}}}
