y counts and the iteration files, which synthesis reads. - Recovery note: none. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n## 12. ACTIVE RISKS\n- 1 active P1 finding(s) — required before release; not a P0 but still blocks PASS.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-close-4c/deep-review-dashboard.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794683927596,"end":1794683928387}}}}
